msgid "Stare"
msgstr "Mirar fijamente"

msgid "Stare passionately"
msgstr "Mirar con pasión"

msgid "Stare calmly"
msgstr "Mirar con calma"

msgid "Stare blankly"
msgstr "Mirar distraído"

msgid "About the Plan"
msgstr "Sobre el plan"

msgid "I hope things go well for Kitamura"
msgstr "Espero que todo le salga bien a Kitamura"

msgid "Tomiie and Sakura will be fine, right?"
msgstr "Tomiie y Sakura estarán bien, ¿no?"

msgid "Kanou-senpai seems stubborn"
msgstr "Kanou-senpai parece terca"

msgid "About Kanou Sisters"
msgstr "Sobre las hermanas Kanou"

msgid "You fought with the older sister......"
msgstr "Te peleaste con la hermana mayor......"

msgid "The younger sister is ridiculously sexy"
msgstr "La hermana menor es absurdamente sexy"

msgid "For sisters, they're not much alike"
msgstr "Para ser hermanas, no se parecen mucho"

msgid "About Kawashima"
msgstr "Sobre Kawashima"

msgid "She put on quite the performance"
msgstr "Hizo una gran actuación"

msgid "Did you hate her right from the start?"
msgstr "¿La odiaste desde el principio?"

msgid "She seems very curious about my amnesia"
msgstr "Le da mucha curiosidad mi amnesia"

msgid "About Kitamura"
msgstr "Sobre Kitamura"

msgid "He's a good guy, so I want to repay him"
msgstr "Es buen tipo, quiero devolverle el favor"

msgid "Was he an exhibitionist, perhaps?"
msgstr "¿Acaso era exhibicionista?"

msgid "Kitamura and Kanou-senpai......"
msgstr "Kitamura y Kanou-senpai......"

msgid "About Yasuko"
msgstr "Sobre Yasuko"

msgid "Seems she has some generous customers"
msgstr "Parece que tiene clientes generosos"

msgid "Never woulda thought she was my mother"
msgstr "Nunca habría pensado que era mi madre"

msgid "Why does she love my old man so much?"
msgstr "¿Por qué ama tanto a mi padre?"

msgid "--Let's Get Info For Tomorrow's Plan!--"
msgstr "--¡Consigamos datos para el plan de mañana!--"

msgid "Taiga「With a good expression like that, the＿plan is sure to go well.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Con una buena expresión como esa,＿seguro que el plan saldrá bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh yeah, leave it to me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, claro, déjamelo a mí.」"

msgid "Taiga「Didn't know you could make that＿expression.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No sabía que podías poner esa expresión.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You can count on me tomorrow!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Puedes contar conmigo mañana!」"

msgid "Taiga「We'd be in trouble if we couldn't.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Estaríamos en problemas si no.」"

msgid "Taiga「They say \"the weaker the dog, the＿more it barks,\" and your eyes are a＿testament to that.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Dicen que \"cuanto más débil el＿perro, más ladra\", y tus ojos＿son la prueba de ello.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, excuse me!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Bueno, disculpa!」"

msgid "Taiga「It's fine, really. Everyone needs to act＿tough sometimes.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Está bien, en serio. Todo el mundo＿necesita hacerse el duro a veces.」"

msgid "Taiga「Save that fighting spirit for tomorrow.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Guarda ese ánimo de lucha para mañana.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien.」"

msgid "Taiga「If you try to condescend to Kanou＿Sumire, you'll be beaten at your own＿game.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Si intentas mirar por encima del＿hombro a Kanou Sumire, te vencerá＿en tu propio juego.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I see......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y-Ya veo......」"

msgid "Taiga「This is no time for games!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡No es momento para juegos!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Jeez, I'm sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ay, lo siento.」"

msgid "Taiga「What's with that look? Gonna mug me?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Y esa cara? ¿Me vas a asaltar?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, I'm not!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Claro que no!」"

msgid "Taiga「Your face is really...... pitiful......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tu cara es muy...... lamentable......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That really hurts, you know.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso sí que duele, ¿sabes?」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't you go see Kanou Sumire with＿that expression tomorrow. You look＿like a psycho.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No vayas a ver a Kanou Sumire con esa＿cara mañana. Pareces un psicópata.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Mind your own business.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ocúpate de tus asuntos.」"

msgid "Taiga「What, has the mongrel gone senile?＿Are you motivated at all?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué, el perro se volvió senil? ¿Tienes＿siquiera algo de motivación?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm not senile......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No estoy senil......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I'm okay! I'm motivated!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡E-Estoy bien! ¡Estoy motivado!」"

msgid "Taiga「We'll make it go well for sure. I want＿Kitamura-kun to be happy.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Seguro que haremos que salga bien.＿Quiero que Kitamura-kun sea feliz.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're really passionate about this,＿Taiga. It's awesome.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「De verdad le pones pasión a＿esto, Taiga. Es genial.」"

msgid "Taiga「Frankly, I acknowledge that you've put＿in some hard work yourself.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Francamente, reconozco que tú también＿te has esforzado bastante.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, I think I did the best I could.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, creo que hice lo mejor que pude.」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't get ahead of yourself.＿Tomorrow's the real deal.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No te adelantes tanto.＿Mañana va en serio.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh yeah.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, sí.」"

msgid "Taiga「In order for things to go well for＿Kitamura, you need to do your job well.＿Understand, Ryuuji?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Para que las cosas le salgan bien＿a Kitamura, tienes que hacer bien＿tu parte. ¿Entendido, Ryuuji?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Right back at you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Lo mismo digo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Let's put 110% into everything we＿can do for Kitamura-kun.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Demos el 110% en todo lo que podamos＿hacer por Kitamura-kun.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, I agree.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, estoy de acuerdo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「He shouldn't be a problem anymore.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Él ya no debería ser un problema.」"

msgid "Taiga「\"Will it be okay\"!? We went through all＿that trouble of setting the stage, so of＿course it'll be okay!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿\"Estarán bien\"?! Nos tomamos toda＿la molestia de preparar el terreno,＿¡así que claro que estarán bien!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, I mean, what with Tomiie's little＿idiosyncracy, we should prepare for＿the worst case scenario......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, digo, con esa peculiaridad＿de Tomiie, deberíamos prepararnos＿para el peor de los casos......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, I don't wanna picture it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ay, ni me lo quiero imaginar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You do have a point there......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「En eso sí tienes razón......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......N-No, let's drop it. If we start＿worrying about that, we'll never stop.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......N-No, dejémoslo. Si nos preocupa＿eso, no acabaremos nunca.」"

msgid "Taiga「You're the one who brought it up.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tú fuiste quien sacó el tema.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm not too sure about that......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No estoy muy seguro de eso......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't say that. That's dangerous.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No digas eso. Es peligroso.」"

msgid "Taiga「Aren't you the one who's supposed to＿do something about it?! Don't throw a＿tantrum!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿No se supone que tú eres quien＿debe hacer algo al respecto?! ¡¡No＿hagas un berrinche!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「A-Alright already! Calm down!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡B-Bueno, ya! ¡Cálmate!」"

msgid "Taiga「I won't answer that.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No voy a responder a eso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I see.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y-Ya veo.」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright, I won't ask about her anymore!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Bien, ya no preguntaré más por ella!」"

msgid "Taiga「My apologies for lacking in sex appeal＿and bustline.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Disculpa por carecer de atractivo＿sexual y de busto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, between the two of you, she's the＿abnormal one.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, entre ustedes dos,＿ella es la anormal.」"

msgid "Taiga「That girl's got it easy! She's a＿revoltingly fat, clumsy nuisance, but all＿is forgiven because of her big tits!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Qué fácil la tiene! Es una molestia＿torpe y asquerosamente gorda, ¡pero se＿lo perdonan todo por sus tetas grandes!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I don't think that's the case.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No creo que sea por eso.」"

msgid "Taiga「Is it that strange for siblings to be＿different?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Es tan raro que los hermanos＿sean diferentes?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, doesn't it make it hard to believe＿they're related?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, ¿no cuesta creer que＿estén emparentadas?」"

msgid "Taiga「Not for me.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Para mí no.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh really......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, en serio......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why are you so upset? I'm sorry for＿mentioning it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué te enojas tanto?＿Perdón por mencionarlo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Hmph!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Jum!」"

msgid "Taiga「Tomorrow's the showdown, and yet＿you're daydreaming about THAT? You＿horndog.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Mañana es el día decisivo, ¿y tú estás＿fantaseando con ESO? Qué pervertido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ngh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ngh......」"

msgid "Taiga「I guess. I don't have any siblings, so I＿don't know the first thing about＿familial resemblance.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Supongo. No tengo hermanos,＿así que no sé nada sobre los＿parecidos de familia.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's the same for me. I have no idea.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Me pasa igual. No tengo ni idea.」"

msgid "Taiga「Sure they are.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Claro que se parecen.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「In what way?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿En qué sentido?」"

msgid "Taiga「They're both repugnant.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Las dos son repugnantes.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Now I get it......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ahora lo entiendo......」"

msgid "Taiga「I already knew StuChi was good at＿acting.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ya sabía que StuChi era buena actuando.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Because she's the daughter of an＿actress, right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Porque es hija de una actriz, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Taiga「I've seen it for myself, 150 times in＿one long rapid-fire burst...... That was＿so much fun. Fufufu......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Lo vi con mis propios ojos, 150＿veces seguidas de golpe...... Fue＿muy divertido. Jujuju......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What are you talking about......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿De qué estás hablando......?」"

msgid "Taiga「You should be grateful to me.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Deberías estarme agradecido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「And why exactly would you say that?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Y por qué exactamente dices eso?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I can't begin to picture that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ni siquiera me lo imagino.」"

msgid "Taiga「It'd be weird if an actress's daughter＿couldn't manage that much.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sería raro que la hija de una actriz＿no pudiera lograr al menos eso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「An actress's daughter...... Never mind.＿She saved our asses, so let's just be＿grateful.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「La hija de una actriz...... Olvídalo.＿Nos salvó el pellejo, así que solo＿agradezcámoslo.」"

msgid "Taiga「She always pretends to be cute and＿friendly, so of course she's good at＿acting.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Siempre finge ser linda y amigable, así＿que claro que es buena actuando.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, I get it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ah, ya entiendo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Want to hear the story of how StuChi＿and I first met?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Quieres oír la historia de cómo＿StuChi y yo nos conocimos?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Nah, I can get the gist of it just from＿the look on your face, so I'll pass.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Nah, me hago una idea solo＿con ver tu cara, así que paso.」"

msgid "Taiga「Just thinking back on it makes me SO＿MAAAAAD!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Solo de recordarlo me＿da TANTA RABIAAAA!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wait, Taiga, calm down! It's my fault for＿asking!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Espera, Taiga, cálmate! ¡Fue＿culpa mía por preguntar!」"

msgid "Taiga「She tricked you right when she first＿met your humble mongrel self.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Te engañó en cuanto conoció a＿un humilde perro como tú.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm not asking about me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No pregunto por mí.」"

msgid "Taiga「I kinda regret that time when we first＿met.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Me arrepiento un poco de aquella＿vez que nos conocimos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What, did you guys get into a fight?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué, acaso se pelearon?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yup. Looking back on it, instead of＿slapping her, I really should have＿slapped her twice.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sip. Pensándolo bien, en vez＿de darle una bofetada, en realidad＿debí darle dos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......That kind of regret, huh.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ese tipo de arrepentimiento, eh.」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah. As I recall, I slapped her when＿we first met.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí. Si mal no recuerdo, la abofeteé＿cuando nos conocimos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay, that's enough. I don't want to＿know any more than that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, ya es suficiente. No＿quiero saber más que eso.」"

msgid "Taiga「She's probably up to no good again.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Seguro trama algo malo otra vez.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I dunno...... She dodges all the＿important questions, so I can't be sure.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No sé...... Esquiva todas las＿preguntas importantes, así＿que no estoy seguro.」"

msgid "Taiga「Excuse me? What, so it amuses her?＿Your memories are not that stupid＿woman's playthings!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Perdón? ¿Qué, le divierte? ¡Tus＿recuerdos no son el juguete de＿esa mujer estúpida!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, that was kinda nice of you to say.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, eso fue algo amable de tu parte.」"

msgid "Taiga「Of course it was! Being nice is my＿livelihood!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Pues claro! ¡Ser amable＿es mi pan de cada día!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What kind of joke is that?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué clase de chiste es ese?」"

msgid "Taiga「Keep up that attitude and everything＿will go well for sure tomorrow.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Mantén esa actitud y mañana seguro＿que todo saldrá bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien.」"

msgid "Taiga「Well, that's sweet of you, Ryuuji.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno, qué lindo de tu parte, Ryuuji.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Really? I think it's just common＿decency.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿En serio? Creo que es simple decencia.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't be absurd.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No seas absurda.」"

msgid "Taiga「If you had even a tenth of＿Kitamura-kun's good qualities......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Si tuvieras siquiera una décima parte de＿las virtudes de Kitamura-kun......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't say that. With this ugly mug, I'm＿already in last place.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No digas eso. Con esta cara fea,＿ya estoy en último lugar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, that's the plan.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, ese es el plan.」"

msgid "Taiga「Even if he was, it couldn't have been as＿mentally scarring as your face.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Aunque lo fuera, no habría sido＿tan traumático como tu cara.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Say what you like, but exhibitionism is＿still bad!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Di lo que quieras, pero el＿exhibicionismo sigue estando mal!」"

msgid "Taiga「He isn't bothering anyone, so what's＿the harm in it?!」"
msgstr "Taiga「No molesta a nadie, así que＿¡¿qué tiene de malo?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, I think it does bother people......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, yo creo que sí molesta......」"

msgid "Taiga「You got a problem with that?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Tienes algún problema con eso?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's not a problem, but it could spell＿trouble for him in certain＿circumstances.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No es un problema, pero podría traerle＿líos en ciertas circunstancias.」"

msgid "Taiga「Sounds like you're just jealous. If it＿bothers you so much, why don't you＿try to get a six-pack too?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Parece que solo tienes envidia. Si tanto＿te molesta, ¿por qué no intentas sacar＿abdominales marcados tú también?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Goddammit......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Maldita sea......」"

msgid "Taiga「......I'd prefer not to comment.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Prefiero no hacer comentarios.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So he is, then......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Entonces sí lo es......」"

msgid "Taiga「You remembered something else,＿huh? That's what's important.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Recordaste algo más, ¿eh?＿Eso es lo que importa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So you're saying you have no problems＿with exhibitionism?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿O sea que no tienes ningún problema＿con el exhibicionismo?」"

msgid "Taiga「I can let it slide!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Puedo dejarlo pasar!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, don't!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Pues no lo hagas!」"

msgid "Taiga「Didn't you hear what I said?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿No escuchaste lo que dije?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright...... I won't ask about it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bien...... No preguntaré por eso.」"

msgid "Taiga「GIVE UP ALREADY!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡YA RÍNDETE!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sorry! Calm down!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Perdón! ¡Cálmate!」"

msgid "Taiga「Shrimp, caviar, foie gras, abalone......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Camarón, caviar, foie gras, abulón......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......We certainly had some delicacies＿this New Year's. Though I barely got to＿try anything.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Sin duda comimos manjares＿este Año Nuevo. Aunque apenas＿pude probar nada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I don't have a grudge or anything,＿but...... not gonna lie, hearing that＿makes me happy.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No guardo rencor ni nada, pero...... no＿voy a mentir, oír eso me hace feliz.」"

msgid "Taiga「\"Magnanimous\" is right. Thanks to＿those sugar daddies, I got to eat to my＿heart's content.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tienes razón con lo de \"generosos\".＿Gracias a esos patrocinadores, pude＿comer hasta reventar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey. Don't call Yasuko's beloved＿customers \"sugar daddies\".」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye. No llames \"patrocinadores\" a＿los queridos clientes de Yasuko.」"

msgid "Taiga「You had the hots for Yacchan before＿you found out, didn't you?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Te atraía Yacchan antes de que＿lo descubrieras, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「N-No I didn't!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡N-No es cierto!」"

msgid "Taiga「Ohhh? Hmmm? You sure about＿that～?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Ohhh? ¿Mmmm? ¿Estás seguro de eso～?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sh...... Shut up!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Cá...... Cállate!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien.」"

msgid "Taiga「You didn't know she was your mom?＿Even a puppy can recognize its＿mother.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿No sabías que era tu mamá? Hasta＿un cachorro reconoce a su madre.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yasuko's a special case!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Yasuko es un caso especial!」"

msgid "Taiga「I guess so. Your faces aren't very＿much alike. That's unfortunate.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Supongo que sí. Sus caras no se＿parecen mucho. Qué lástima.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'd be concerned if I looked like＿Yasuko.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Me preocuparía si me pareciera a Yasuko.」"

msgid "Taiga「Did you just scoff at Yacchan and your＿father?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Acabas de burlarte de Yacchan＿y de tu padre?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「N-No I didn't.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「N-No lo hice.」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't poke fun at the things Yacchan＿holds dear!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡No te burles de las cosas＿que Yacchan aprecia!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sorry, that wasn't my intention......＿Forget it, please.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Perdón, no era mi intención......＿Olvídalo, por favor.」"

msgid "Taiga「Not able to stomach the fact that＿Yacchan loves your father? You're a＿mama's boy.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿No puedes digerir el hecho＿de que Yacchan ame a tu padre?＿Eres un niño de mamá.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'll admit I'm a mama's boy, but that's＿not how I meant it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Admito que soy un niño de mamá,＿pero no lo decía por eso.」"

msgid "Taiga「So you admit it......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Así que lo admites......」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm sure she's had a lot to think about＿during their time apart.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Seguro que ha tenido mucho en＿qué pensar durante el tiempo＿que pasaron separados.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Probably......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Probablemente......」"

msgid "Taiga「It's a good thing. What's the harm in it?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Es algo bueno. ¿Qué tiene de malo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I didn't say there was harm in it. In a＿sense, I'm jealous that she can be so＿open about it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No dije que tuviera nada de malo. En＿cierto sentido, me da envidia que pueda＿ser tan abierta al respecto.」"

